                    <div class="p-6 pt-16 text-center">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Jax</h3>
                        <p class="text-blue-400 mb-4">The Tech Genius</p>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                            Luminara's tech-savvy best friend who provides support and humor. 
                            Helps Luminara understand and train her newfound powers.
                        </p>
                        <div class="mt-4 flex justify-center space-x-2">
                            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-blue-500 bg-opacity-20 text-blue-400 rounded-full text-xs">Tech Expert</span>
                            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-green-500 bg-opacity-20 text-green-400 rounded-full text-xs">Loyal</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Scenes Tab (Hidden by default) -->
        <section id="scenes-tab" class="tab-content hidden">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 glow-text">Key Scenes</h2>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <!-- Scene 1 -->
                <div class="scene-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden h-64 relative" style="background-image: url('https://placeholder.co/600x400')">
                    <div class="scene-overlay absolute inset-0 p-6 flex flex-col justify-end">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">City Under Siege</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                            The opening scene shows the city in chaos as Umbrax's shadow minions attack civilians and infrastructure.
                        </p>
                        <button class="mt-3 self-start px-4 py-2 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 rounded-lg text-sm transition">
                            Watch Scene
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Scene 2 -->
                <div class="scene-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden h-64 relative" style="background-image: url('https://placeholder.co/600x400')">
                    <div class="scene-overlay absolute inset-0 p-6 flex flex-col justify-end">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Power Awakening</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                            Luminara discovers her light manipulation powers in a moment of desperation and fear.
                        </p>
                        <button class="mt-3 self-start px-4 py-2 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 rounded-lg text-sm transition">
                            Watch Scene
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Scene 3 -->
                <div class="scene-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden h-64 relative" style="background-image: url('https://placeholder.co/600x400')">
                    <div class="scene-overlay absolute inset-0 p-6 flex flex-col justify-end">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Training Montage</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                            Jax helps Luminara train and understand her powers through a series of challenges.
                        </p>
                        <button class="mt-3 self-start px-4 py-2 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 rounded-lg text-sm transition">
                            Watch Scene
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Scene 4 -->
                <div class="scene-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden h-64 relative" style="background-image: url('https://placeholder.co/600x400')">
                    <div class="scene-overlay absolute inset-0 p-6 flex flex-col justify-end">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Final Battle</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                            The climactic rooftop battle between Luminara and Umbrax, with the city's fate hanging in the balance.
                        </p>
                        <button class="mt-3 self-start px-4 py-2 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 rounded-lg text-sm transition">
                            Watch Scene
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Powers Tab (Hidden by default) -->
        <section id="powers-tab" class="tab-content hidden">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 glow-text">Superpowers</h2>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <!-- Light Powers -->
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-900 to-yellow-800 rounded-xl p-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-yellow-500 flex items-center justify-center mr-4 power-light">
                            <i class="fas fa-sun text-white text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Light Manipulation</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
                        Luminara can create, shape, and manipulate visible light. Her powers include:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="space-y-2">
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-circle text-yellow-400 text-xs mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span>Creating blinding flashes of light</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-circle text-yellow-400 text-xs mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span>Forming solid light constructs (shields, weapons)</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-circle text-yellow-400 text-xs mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span>Healing light that can repair damage</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-circle text-yellow-400 text-xs mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span>Light beams capable of destroying shadow creatures</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Shadow Powers -->
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gray-600 flex items-center justify-center mr-4 power-dark">
                            <i class="fas fa-moon text-white text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Shadow Control</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
                        Umbrax has complete mastery over darkness and shadows. His abilities include:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="space-y-2">
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-circle text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span>Creating shadow creatures to do his bidding</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-circle text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span>Teleporting through shadows</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-circle text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span>Shadow tendrils that can restrain or attack</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start">
                            <i class="fas fa-circle text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                            <span>Darkness that drains light and energy</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-900 to-blue-900 rounded-xl p-6">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">The Balance of Light and Dark</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300">
                    The movie explores the theme that neither light nor darkness can exist without the other. 
                    Luminara learns that true power comes from understanding this balance, not just destroying the darkness.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Soundtrack Tab (Hidden by default) -->
        <section id="soundtrack-tab" class="tab-content hidden">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 glow-text">Soundtrack</h2>
            
            <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-xl p-6">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <!-- Track 1 -->
